msgid "<0>/subscribe feed:Top plays country:{country}</0> posts every new {country} top play into the channel it's run in. The other feeds are snipes and new farm maps, and <1>min_pp</1> skips scores below a threshold. <2>/subscriptions</2> lists a server's active feeds, <3>/unsubscribe</3> stops one. Subscribing needs Manage Server."
