#: src/routes/dan-estimates.tsx
#~ msgid "<0>It is not a ranking.</0> Two players a step apart on the dan leaderboard are not meaningfully apart, and a player who never farms accuracy will read lower than they play."
#~ msgstr "<0>它不是排名。</0> 段位排行榜上相差一个台阶的两名玩家，其实分不出高下，而从不刷准确率的玩家，显示出来的段位会低于其真实水平。"

