#~ msgid "<0>It is not a title.</0> The ladders hand those out for clearing the course, and this number has no say in that."
#~ msgstr "<0>它不是称号。</0> 称号是各段位表发给通过课题的人的，这个数字说了不算。"

#: src/routes/dan-estimates.tsx
#~ msgid "<0>It moves.</0> The rating engines and the chart analysis get improved, and a recompute can shift a chart by a step, which shifts everyone whose evidence sat on it."
#~ msgstr "<0>它会变。</0> 评分算法和谱面分析都在改进，一次重算可能把某张谱面挪动一个台阶，靠这张谱面撑着的人也会跟着动。"

#: src/routes/dan-estimates.tsx
#~ msgid "<0>It only sees the plays the site has.</0> Your osu! top plays are always in. Anything below them exists only if the site tracks you, which means sitting in your country's top 100 or turning tracking on yourself, and only from the day that started. Someone who stopped playing years ago is judged on their top 200 alone and reads low for that reason."
#~ msgstr "<0>它只看得到本站有的成绩。</0> 你的 osu! 最佳成绩一定在内。排在这些之外的成绩，只有在本站追踪你的时候才存在，也就是你在所在国家/地区的前 100 名，或者你自己开了追踪，而且只从开始追踪那天算起。多年前就不玩了的玩家只能靠 top 200 来判断，显示出来自然偏低。"

