#: src/routes/dan-estimates.tsx
#~ msgid "A pass at the bar credits the chart's full level, the same as passing the course, and so does the first point above it: a 96.9% on a 96% ladder is a normal clear, not a bonus. Above that the bonus stays small until 99%, then it climbs. Under the bar a pass still counts, as a clear of a lower level, down to a level and a quarter less at the cutoff. Regular ladders credit to 4 points under the bar and 6K/7K LN to 1. 4K LN uses its own numbers: it credits down to 94.5%, a level and a half less there, and its bonus tops out at 99.7%:"
#~ msgstr "正好达到通过线的通过，会按谱面的完整段位计入，和通过段位课题一样；通过线上方的第一个百分点也一样：在 96% 的段位表上打出 96.9% 只算普通通过，没有加成。再往上加成一直很小，到 99% 才开始上升。低于通过线的成绩仍然计入，按更低的段位计为通过，最低到截止处比谱面段位低一又四分之一级。普通段位表计入到通过线以下 4 个百分点，6K/7K LN 到 1 个百分点。4K LN 用自己的一套数值：向下计入到 94.5%，在那里比谱面段位低一级半，加成在 99.7% 到顶："

#: src/routes/dan-estimates.tsx
#~ msgid "A pass right at the bar credits the chart's full level, exactly as passing the course would, and so does the first stretch above it: a 96.9% on a 96% ladder is a bare clear, not a bonus. Above that the bonus stays small until 99%, where the real ramp opens. A near miss under the bar still credits something: a play counts as a clear of a lower level, bottoming out a level and a quarter down at the cutoff. The regular ladders keep crediting to 4 points under the bar, 6K/7K LN to 1 point. 4K LN has a curve of its own, because its bar is written in ScoreV2 and a 100% is out of reach on most charts with long notes: it credits down to 94.5% and bottoms out a level and a half down there, and its bonus reaches its top at 99.7% rather than at an accuracy nobody sets:"
#~ msgstr "正好达到通过线的通过，会按谱面的完整段位计入，就像通过真正的段位课题一样；通过线上方的第一小段也是如此：在 96% 的段位表上打出 96.9% 只算普通通过，没有加成。再往上加成也一直很小，到 99% 才真正开始上升。差一点没到通过线也仍有计入：成绩会按更低的段位计为通过，最低到截止处比谱面段位低一又四分之一级。普通段位表在通过线以下 4 个百分点内仍然计入，6K/7K LN 只到 1 个百分点。4K LN 有自己的一条曲线：它的通过线以 ScoreV2 计算，而在大多数有长条的谱面上 100% 根本打不出来，所以它向下计入到 94.5%，并在那里降到低一级半，加成也在 99.7% 就到顶，而不是停在一个没人打得出的准确率上："

