#: src/routes/dan-estimates.tsx
msgid "A quick reminder of what a dan is"
msgstr "先说清楚段位是什么"

#: src/routes/dan-estimates.tsx
msgid "A run only counts if it was really the course. Easy, No Fail and Random disqualify it, and so does anything that slows the chart down: Half Time, Daycore, or a custom rate under 1.0x. Mirror, Hidden, Fade In, Flashlight, Hard Rock, Sudden Death, Perfect and Double Time are all fine, because none of them make the course easier. A pass recorded before mod data was stored cannot be checked, so it counts for nothing rather than being taken on trust. <0>Clicking your dan badge shows the course that set your estimate, when one did.</0>"
msgstr "只有真的按课题打的成绩才算。Easy、No Fail 和 Random 会让它作废，任何拖慢谱面的东西也一样：Half Time、Daycore，或者低于 1.0x 的自定义倍速。Mirror、Hidden、Fade In、Flashlight、Hard Rock、Sudden Death、Perfect 和 Double Time 都没问题，因为它们都不会让课题变简单。在开始存储 Mod 数据之前记录的通过成绩无法核对，所以宁可不算，也不会直接当作有效。<0>点开你的段位徽章，就能看到是哪个课题定下了你的估算，如果有的话。</0>"

#: src/routes/dan-estimates.tsx
#~ msgid "A run only counts if it was really the course. Easy, No Fail and Random disqualify it, and so does anything that slows the chart down: Half Time, Daycore, or a custom rate under 1.0x. Mirror, Hidden, Fade In, Flashlight, Hard Rock, Sudden Death, Perfect and Double Time are all fine, because none of them make the course easier. A pass the site recorded before it stored mods cannot be checked, so it counts for nothing rather than being taken on trust. <0>Clicking your dan badge shows the course that set your estimate, when one did.</0>"
#~ msgstr "只有真的按课题打的成绩才算。Easy、No Fail 和 Random 会让它作废，任何拖慢谱面的东西也一样：Half Time、Daycore，或者低于 1.0x 的自定义倍速。Mirror、Hidden、Fade In、Flashlight、Hard Rock、Sudden Death、Perfect 和 Double Time 都没问题，因为它们都不会让课题变简单。本站在开始记录 mod 之前存下的成绩无法核对，所以宁可不算，也不会默认它没问题。<0>点开你的段位徽章，就能看到是哪个课题定下了你的估算，如果有的话。</0>"

#: src/routes/dan-estimates.tsx
#~ msgid "A run only counts if it was really the course. Easy, No Fail, Half Time, Daycore, Random, the key mods and anything that slows the chart down disqualify it; Mirror, Hidden, Fade In, Flashlight, Hard Rock, Sudden Death, Perfect and Double Time are fine. A pass the site recorded before it stored mods cannot be checked, so it counts for nothing rather than being taken on trust. <0>Clicking your dan badge shows the course that set your estimate, when one did.</0>"
#~ msgstr "只有真的按课题打的成绩才算。Easy、No Fail、Half Time、Daycore、Random、按键 mod，以及任何拖慢谱面的东西都会让它作废；Mirror、Hidden、Fade In、Flashlight、Hard Rock、Sudden Death、Perfect 和 Double Time 都没问题。本站在开始记录 mod 之前存下的成绩无法核对，所以宁可不算，也不会默认它没问题。<0>点开你的段位徽章，就能看到是哪个课题定下了你的估算，如果有的话。</0>"

