#: src/routes/dan-estimates.tsx
#~ msgid "Every qualifying pass lands in one of four skills, and those four are what the estimate is built out of. On 4K they are jack, tech, speed and stamina, taken from the play's own MSD skillset ratings and filed under whichever skillset is strongest on that chart: jack (JackSpeed and Chordjack), tech (Technical and Jumpstream), speed (Stream) and stamina (Handstream and Stamina)."
#~ msgstr "每一次达标通过都会落到四个技能中的一个，而整个估算就是用这四个搭起来的。4K 这边是叠、技、速度和耐力，取自成绩本身的 MSD 技能项评分，按谱面上最强的那一项归类：叠(JackSpeed 和 Chordjack)、技(Technical 和 Jumpstream)、速度(Stream)、耐力(Handstream 和 Stamina)。"

#: src/routes/dan-estimates.tsx
msgid "Every qualifying pass lands in one of four skills, and those four are what the estimate is built out of. On 4K they are jack, tech, speed and stamina, taken from the play's own MSD skillset ratings and normally filed under whichever skillset is strongest on that chart: jack (JackSpeed and Chordjack), tech (Technical and Jumpstream), speed (Stream) and stamina (Handstream and Stamina)."
msgstr "每一次达标通过都会落到四个技能中的一个，而整个估算就是用这四个搭起来的。4K 这边是叠、技、速度和耐力，取自成绩本身的 MSD 技能项评分，通常按谱面上最强的那一项归类：叠（JackSpeed 和 Chordjack）、技（Technical 和 Jumpstream）、速度（Stream）、耐力（Handstream 和 Stamina）。"

#: src/routes/dan-estimates.tsx
#~ msgid "Every step above is the site guessing. A dan course pass is not guesswork: there is a pass mark, and you were over it. So when the site sees one, your estimate for that side <0>cannot read below the course you passed</0>, whatever your skills average to. Clear EXTRA-EPSILON and you read as epsilon even if your skills average out to delta."
#~ msgstr "上面每一步都是本站在猜。通过一个段位课题不是猜：有一条及格线，而你过了。所以只要本站看到这么一次，你在那一侧的估算<0>就不会低于你通过的那个课题</0>，不管技能平均下来是多少。打过 EXTRA-EPSILON，你就读作 epsilon，哪怕你的技能平均下来只到 delta。"

