msgid "Hitting the accuracy bar gives full credit for the chart's level. The next 1% above the bar still gives full credit. After that, bonus credit starts. It stays small until 99%, then rises faster. Scores below the bar can still count at a lower level. Regular charts count down to 4% below the bar, while 6K/7K LN charts count down to 1% below it. At those cutoffs, the chart counts as 1.25 levels lower. 4K LN counts down to 94.5%, where the chart is worth 1.5 levels less, and its bonus stops rising at 99.7%:"
msgstr "达到准确率通过线，就按谱面段位给满额计入。通过线以上的第一个百分点同样是满额计入。再往上才开始有加成，加成到 99% 之前都很小，之后上升更快。低于通过线的成绩仍然可以按更低的段位计入。普通谱面计入到通过线以下 4 个百分点，6K/7K LN 谱面计入到 1 个百分点。在这些截止点上，谱面按低 1.25 级计入。4K LN 计入到 94.5%，在那里谱面低 1.5 级，加成则在 99.7% 停止上升："

