msgid "Jumpstream sits with tech on purpose. MinaCalc's Jumpstream fires hard on dense jumptrill, which feels a lot more like tech than like speed, so pairing it with Stream put charts like Blastix Riotz [GRAVITY] on a tile labelled speed. Checked against a 25 chart pack of real gamma speed charts, Stream alone picks all 25 and rejects the jumptrill charts by a wide margin."
