#: src/routes/privacy.tsx
msgid "Mania Tracker counts page views and feature usage with its own first-party analytics, stored on the site's own server. Events are sent through the site's own endpoint and can include the visited route, selected country, referrer, browser language, screen size, and route context such as a viewed player, score, beatmapset, or maps tab. Events are kept for 90 days and then deleted."
msgstr "Mania Tracker 用自己的第一方分析来统计页面访问和功能使用情况，数据存在本站自己的服务器上。事件通过本站自己的接口发送，可能包含访问的路由、所选国家/地区、来源页、浏览器语言、屏幕尺寸，以及路由上下文，例如所查看的玩家、成绩、谱面集或谱面标签页。事件保留 90 天后删除。"

#: src/routes/terms.tsx
msgid "Mania Tracker displays public metadata, cached projections, and derived community views for reference. To report a bug, use the <0>Report a bug</0> form on the site. If you own content shown on the site and have an attribution, takedown, or data concern, email <1>contact@mania-tracker.com</1> or contact the maintainer through the public osu! profile linked in the footer."
msgstr "Mania Tracker 展示公开的元数据、缓存的投影数据和衍生的社区视图，供参考之用。要反馈 bug，请使用站内的 <0>反馈 bug</0> 表单。如果本站展示的内容归你所有，且你有署名、下架或数据方面的问题，请发邮件至 <1>contact@mania-tracker.com</1>，或通过页脚链接的公开 osu! 个人资料联系维护者。"

#: src/routes/privacy.tsx
msgid "Mania Tracker does not sell personal data. Data may be processed by service providers used to run the site, including hosting, storage, analytics, osu! API services, and community score-data services. Public osu! data may be cached and re-displayed as part of the site's community features."
msgstr "Mania Tracker 不出售个人数据。数据可能会由运营本站所用的服务提供商处理，包括托管、存储、分析、osu! API 服务和社区成绩数据服务。公开的 osu! 数据可能会被缓存并作为本站社区功能的一部分重新展示。"

#: src/routes/terms.tsx
msgid "Mania Tracker is a community project built on external data sources, so rankings, score views, snipes, top plays, maps, farm-helper suggestions, replay views, dan estimates, and other generated surfaces may be delayed, incomplete, unavailable, or incorrect. Features may change, break, or be removed."
msgstr "Mania Tracker 是一个建立在外部数据源之上的社区项目，因此排名、成绩视图、狙击、最佳成绩、谱面、刷图助手推荐、回放视图、段位估算，以及其它生成的界面，都可能出现延迟、不完整、不可用或不准确的情况。功能也可能变动、失效或被移除。"

#: src/routes/legal.tsx
msgid "Mania Tracker is a community project built on external data sources, so rankings, scores, snipes, top plays, replay views, and other generated surfaces may be delayed, incomplete, unavailable, or incorrect."
msgstr "Mania Tracker 是一个建立在外部数据源之上的社区项目，因此排名、成绩、狙击、最佳成绩、回放视图，以及其它生成的界面，都可能出现延迟、不完整、不可用或不准确的情况。"

#: src/routes/privacy.tsx
msgid "Mania Tracker is an osu!mania community site built around public osu! data, cached projections, and user preferences. This policy explains the data used to operate the site."
msgstr "Mania Tracker 是一个 osu!mania 社区网站，围绕公开的 osu! 数据、缓存的投影数据和用户偏好构建。本政策说明运营本站所使用的数据。"

#: src/routes/legal.tsx
#: src/routes/terms.tsx
msgid "Mania Tracker is an unofficial community fan project for osu!mania players. It is not affiliated with, endorsed by, sponsored by, or approved by ppy Pty Ltd or the osu! team."
msgstr "Mania Tracker 是一个面向 osu!mania 玩家的非官方社区同人项目。它与 ppy Pty Ltd 或 osu! 团队没有从属关系，也未获得其背书、赞助或批准。"

#: src/routes/terms.tsx
msgid "Mania Tracker uses osu! OAuth to identify the signed-in osu! account. Mania Tracker does not receive or manage your osu! password."
msgstr "Mania Tracker 使用 osu! OAuth 来识别已登录的 osu! 账号。Mania Tracker 不会收到或管理你的 osu! 密码。"

#: src/routes/legal.tsx
msgid "Mania Tracker uses public and authenticated osu! API data, locally cached data, server projections, and community data services such as <0>osu! score cache</0>."
msgstr "Mania Tracker 使用公开和已授权的 osu! API 数据、本地缓存数据、服务器投影数据，以及 <0>osu! score cache</0> 等社区数据服务。"

#: src/routes/privacy.tsx
msgid "Mania Tracker uses public osu! profile, score, beatmap, beatmapset, ranking, and replay metadata, plus community data services such as osu! score cache, to build rankings, tracker views, maps, snipes, top plays, farm-helper suggestions, profiles, and replay views."
msgstr "Mania Tracker 使用公开的 osu! 个人资料、成绩、谱面、谱面集、排名和回放的元数据，以及 osu! score cache 等社区数据服务，来构建排名、追踪器视图、谱面、狙击、最佳成绩、刷图助手推荐、个人资料和回放视图。"

