#: src/routes/dan-estimates.tsx
#~ msgid "No ladder recognises this number. Titles come from clearing a real course, and nothing here has a say in who gets one. It makes a poor ranking too, since two players a step apart on the dan leaderboard are not meaningfully apart and anyone who never farms accuracy reads lower than they play. It also drifts, because the rating engines and the chart analysis keep getting better, so a recompute that moves a chart by a step moves everyone whose evidence sat on that chart."
#~ msgstr "没有任何段位表承认这个数字。称号来自通过真正的段位课题，这里的一切对谁能获得称号都说了不算。它也当不了排名：段位排行榜上相差一级的两名玩家并没有实质差距，从不刷准确率的玩家读出来也会比实际水平低。它还会漂移，因为评分算法和谱面分析一直在变好，一次重算把某张谱面挪动一级，靠这张谱面作为依据的所有人也会跟着动。"

#: src/routes/dan-estimates.tsx
#~ msgid "No ladder recognizes this number, and titles still come from clearing a real course. It also makes a poor ranking, since two players a step apart on the dan leaderboard are not meaningfully apart and anyone who never farms accuracy reads lower than they play. It is not fixed either: the rating engines and the chart analysis keep getting better, and a recompute that moves a chart by a step moves everyone whose evidence sat on that chart."
#~ msgstr "没有哪个段位系统承认这个数字，头衔仍然只能靠真正打过课题来拿。它当排名也不好用，段位榜上差一级的两个人并没有真的差一级，从不刷准度的人看起来会比实际水平低。它也不是定死的：评级算法和谱面分析一直在改进，一次重算把某张谱面挪一级，就会带动所有把证据压在这张谱面上的人。"

#: src/routes/dan-estimates.tsx
msgid "No ladder recognizes this number, and titles still only come from clearing a real course. A player who never farms accuracy will land below their actual level. The number can also change on its own, because the rating engines and the chart analysis get updated, and when a recompute moves a chart up or down a level, everyone whose passes rely on that chart moves with it."
msgstr "没有哪个段位系统承认这个数字，头衔仍然只能靠真正打过课题来拿。从不刷准度的玩家会落在自己真实水平之下。这个数字本身也会变，因为评级算法和谱面分析会更新，一次重算把某张谱面上调或下调一级，所有靠这张谱面撑着的人也跟着动。"

#: src/routes/dan-estimates.tsx
#~ msgid "No ladder recognizes this number, and titles still only come from clearing a real course. It also works badly as a ranking. Two players one step apart on the dan leaderboard are not really one step apart, and a player who never farms accuracy will land below their actual level. The number can also change on its own, because the rating engines and the chart analysis get updated, and when a recompute moves a chart up or down a level, everyone whose passes rely on that chart moves with it."
#~ msgstr "没有哪个段位系统承认这个数字，头衔仍然只能靠真正打过课题来拿。它当排名也不好用。段位榜上差一级的两个人并不是真的差一级，从不刷准度的玩家会落在自己真实水平之下。这个数字本身也会变，因为评级算法和谱面分析会更新，一次重算把某张谱面上调或下调一级，所有靠这张谱面撑着的人也跟着动。"

