#: src/routes/dan-estimates.tsx
#~ msgid "On 4K the slices come from the play's own MSD skillset ratings, bucketed by whichever skillset is strongest on that chart: jack (JackSpeed and Chordjack), tech (Technical and Jumpstream), speed (Stream) and stamina (Handstream and Stamina). Jumpstream sits with tech on purpose. MinaCalc's Jumpstream fires hard on dense jumptrill, which feels a lot more like tech than like speed, so pairing it with Stream put charts like Blastix Riotz [GRAVITY] on a tile labelled speed. Checked against a 25 chart pack of real gamma speed charts, Stream alone picks all 25 and rejects the jumptrill charts by a wide margin."
#~ msgstr "4K 这边的分项来自成绩本身的 MSD 技能项评分，按谱面上最强的那一项归类：叠(JackSpeed 和 Chordjack)、技(Technical 和 Jumpstream)、速度(Stream)、耐力(Handstream 和 Stamina)。把 Jumpstream 放进技是有意为之。MinaCalc 的 Jumpstream 在密集对拍上会飙得很高，而那种谱面打起来更像技而不是速度，所以一旦把它和 Stream 归在一起，Blastix Riotz [GRAVITY] 这类谱面就会被贴到速度那一格。拿一个装了 25 张真正 gamma 速度谱的谱包来验证，只用 Stream 能把这 25 张全部选中，并且以很大的差距把对拍谱排除掉。"

#: src/components/me/GoalsPanel.tsx
msgid "on a map"
msgstr "单图"

#: src/routes/dan-estimates.tsx
msgid "On dense charts Stream and Technical often rate within a fraction of each other, and whichever edges ahead is close to a coin flip. Speed normally wins those near-ties, but when Technical sits that close and the chart analysis itself is confident the chart is tech, the pass files under tech instead."
msgstr "在密集谱面上，Stream 和 Technical 的评分经常只差一丝，哪个略微领先几乎等于抛硬币。这种几乎持平的情况通常判给速度，但当 Technical 咬得这么紧、而谱面分析本身也确信这张谱是技时，这次通过就会改归到技。"

#: src/routes/dan-estimates.tsx
msgid "One dan level is wide, so each is split into five steps. A chart can be 7--, 7-, 7, 7+ or 7++, from the easiest end of 7th dan to the hardest. Those suffixes are ordering inside a level, nothing more."
msgstr "一个段位的跨度很大，所以每个段位又分成五档。一张谱面可以是 7--、7-、7、7+ 或 7++，从 7 段最简单的一端排到最难的一端。这些后缀只是段位内部的排序，没有别的意思。"

