#: src/routes/dan-estimates.tsx
#~ msgid "The engine gives back a continuous number, and the number is what everything else uses. The label you see is just that number printed in the ladder's own language. 4K regular runs 1st to 10th and then into the greek levels (alpha, beta, gamma and up). 4K LN runs 1 to 17, numbered up to 10 and named above it: Yoake, Yuugure, Yoru, Yami, Yume, Yokaze, Yeehee. 7K runs 0 to 10th and then Gamma, Azimuth, Zenith, Stellium. 6K stops at 9th, and its LN ladder carries on through Terra, Celestial, Mystery, Nihility and Finish."
#~ msgstr "算法给回来的是一个连续的数值，后面所有东西用的都是这个数值。你看到的标签只是把这个数值用各段位表自己的说法印出来而已。4K 单点从 1 段排到 10 段，再进入希腊字母段位(alpha、beta、gamma 往上)。4K LN 从 1 排到 17，10 以内用数字，往上用名字：Yoake、Yuugure、Yoru、Yami、Yume、Yokaze、Yeehee。7K 从 0 段排到 10 段，再是 Gamma、Azimuth、Zenith、Stellium。6K 到 9 段为止，它的 LN 段位表继续往上是 Terra、Celestial、Mystery、Nihility 和 Finish。"

#: src/routes/dan-estimates.tsx
msgid "The engine gives back a continuous number, and the number is what everything else uses. The label you see is just that number printed in the ladder's own language. 4K regular runs 1st to 10th and then into the greek levels (alpha, beta, gamma and up). 4K LN runs 1 to 17, numbered up to 10 and named above it: Yoake, Yuugure, Yoru, Yami, Yume, Yokaze, Yeehee. 7K runs 0 to 10th and then Gamma, Azimuth, Zenith, Stellium. Both 6K ladders run 0 to 9th and then Terra, Celestial, Mystery, Nihility and Finish."
msgstr "算法给回来的是一个连续的数值，后面所有东西用的都是这个数值。你看到的标签只是把这个数值用各段位表自己的说法印出来而已。4K 单点从 1 段排到 10 段，再进入希腊字母段位(alpha、beta、gamma 往上)。4K LN 从 1 排到 17，10 以内用数字，往上用名字：Yoake、Yuugure、Yoru、Yami、Yume、Yokaze、Yeehee。7K 从 0 段排到 10 段，再是 Gamma、Azimuth、Zenith、Stellium。6K 两套段位表都从 0 段排到 9 段，再是 Terra、Celestial、Mystery、Nihility 和 Finish。"

