#: src/routes/dan-estimates.tsx
msgid "The estimate only sees scores it has. Your osu! top plays are always included, and history below them is recorded automatically while you are tracked. Missing older scores are not permanently lost: open the Skills tab on your profile, choose <0>Add a missing score</0>, and paste the osu! score link. A player who quit years ago may start with a low estimate from their top 200 alone, but qualifying old clears can be added instead of replayed."
msgstr "估算只能看到本站已有的成绩。你的 osu! 最佳成绩一定会计入；低于它们的历史成绩，会在你被追踪期间自动记录。缺失的旧成绩并非永远丢失：打开个人主页的“技能”标签页，选择 <0>添加缺失的成绩</0>，再粘贴 osu! 成绩链接。退坑多年的玩家一开始可能只靠 top 200 而估算偏低，但符合条件的旧通过可以直接补上，不必重打。"

#: src/routes/dan-estimates.tsx
#~ msgid "The estimate only sees the recorded pool. Your osu! top plays are always included. Anything below them is included only while you are tracked, which happens if you are in your country's top 100 or if you turn tracking on yourself, and only from that day onward. A player who quit years ago is judged on their top 200 alone, so their estimate comes out low."
#~ msgstr "估算只能读取已记录的成绩池。你的 osu! 最佳成绩始终会被计入，更低的成绩只有在你被追踪期间才会计入：你进入所在国家/地区前 100 名或自行开启追踪后才会被追踪，而且只从当天开始。已经退坑多年的玩家只能按其前 200 个最佳成绩估算，因此结果会偏低。"

