#: src/routes/dan-estimates.tsx
#~ msgid "The pool is your osu! top plays plus every play the site tracked for you, deduplicated down to your best play on each chart at each speed. That tracked half only exists if you are on your country's roster, which is its top 100 plus anyone who turned tracking on themselves, and it starts the day tracking does. Charts flagged as vibro are thrown out everywhere, because the rating engines read a mash wall as enormous density and rate it absurdly."
#~ msgstr "池子是你的 osu! 最佳成绩，加上本站为你追踪到的所有成绩，再按每张谱面每个速度只保留你最好的一次去重。追踪的那一半只有在你进了所在国家/地区的名单时才有，名单是该地区前 100 名，再加上自己开了追踪的人，而且从开始追踪那天才算起。被标为 Vibro 的谱面在任何地方都会被丢掉，因为评分算法会把一堵乱搓的音符墙读成极高的密度，评出离谱的数值。"

#: src/routes/dan-estimates.tsx
#~ msgid "The pool is your osu! top plays plus everything recorded while you were tracked, deduplicated down to your best play on each chart at each speed. That tracked half only exists if you are on your country's roster, which is its top 100 plus anyone who turned tracking on themselves, and it starts the day tracking does. Charts flagged as vibro are thrown out everywhere, because the rating engines read a mash wall as enormous density and rate it absurdly."
#~ msgstr "成绩池由你的 osu! 最佳成绩和追踪期间记录的所有成绩组成，并按每张谱面、每个速度只保留最好的一次。只有进入所在国家/地区的名单后才有追踪得到的那部分数据；名单包括该国家/地区前 100 名和自行开启追踪的人，而且从开始追踪当天才计入。标为 Vibro 的谱面一律排除，因为评级引擎会把一堵乱搓音符墙识别为极高密度，给出离谱的评级。"

#: src/routes/dan-estimates.tsx
msgid "The pool is your osu! top plays, everything recorded while you were tracked, and any score links added manually, deduplicated down to your best play on each chart at each speed. Automatic history below your top plays only exists if you are on your country's roster, which is its top 100 plus anyone who turned tracking on themselves, and it starts the day tracking does. Charts flagged as vibro are thrown out everywhere, because the rating engines read a mash wall as enormous density and rate it absurdly."
msgstr "成绩池由你的 osu! 最佳成绩、追踪期间记录的所有成绩，以及手动添加的成绩链接组成，并按每张谱面、每个速度只保留最好的一次。只有进入所在国家/地区的名单后，最佳成绩以下的历史成绩才会被自动记录；名单包括该国家/地区前 100 名和自行开启追踪的人，而且从开始追踪当天才计入。标为 Vibro 的谱面一律排除，因为评级引擎会把一堵乱搓音符墙识别为极高密度，给出离谱的评级。"

