#: src/routes/dan-estimates.tsx
#~ msgid "The same goes for any session where you never set a score on a ranked, qualified or loved chart: the site never notices you are playing, so nothing from that session is recorded either. <0>Why that is</0>. If your estimate reads low, that is usually the reason, and the only fix is to play more."
#~ msgstr "任何一次你都没有在 ranked、qualified 或 loved 谱面上打出成绩的游玩过程也一样：本站根本不会发现你在打，所以那段时间里的成绩同样不会被记录。<0>为什么会这样</0>。如果你的估算偏低，通常就是这个原因，唯一的办法就是多打一些。"

#: src/routes/dan-estimates.tsx
msgid "The same goes for any session where you never set a score on a ranked, qualified or loved chart: tracking never notices you are playing, so nothing from that session is recorded either. <0>Why that is</0>. If your estimate reads low, add the important missing scores from the Skills tab or keep playing to let new scores fill it in."
msgstr "如果你整场都没有在上架、qualified 或 loved 谱面上打出成绩，也会发生同样的情况：追踪根本不会发现你正在游玩，因此这场里的所有成绩都不会被记录。<0>为什么会这样</0>。如果估算偏低，可以在“技能”标签页补上重要的缺失成绩，也可以继续游玩，让新成绩逐步补全估算。"

#: src/routes/dan-estimates.tsx
#~ msgid "The same goes for any session where you never set a score on a ranked, qualified or loved chart: tracking never notices you are playing, so nothing from that session is recorded either. <0>Why that is</0>. If your estimate reads low, that is usually the reason, and the only fix is to play more."
#~ msgstr "如果你整场都没有在上架、qualified 或 loved 谱面上打出成绩，也会发生同样的情况：追踪根本不会发现你正在游玩，因此这场里的所有成绩都不会被记录。<0>为什么会这样</0>。估算偏低通常就是因为这个，唯一的解决办法是多打一些。"

#: src/routes/dan-estimates.tsx
#~ msgid "The same shape rides every ladder's own bar, so on 4K LN the scale sits against 97% and stops crediting at 93%. A sub-bar credit is always at least a step under the chart's own level: a near miss never reads as the full clear."
#~ msgstr "同样的曲线套在每个段位表自己的通过线上，所以在 4K LN 上这套刻度以 97% 为基准，低于 93% 就不再计入。低于通过线的计入永远至少比谱面本身低一档：差一点没到永远不会被当成完整通过。"

