#: src/routes/legal.tsx
msgid "The site caches, queues, and reuses data to avoid repeatedly requesting the same information from osu!. Live features are built from the site's own server projections, with refresh jobs used to fill in missing details and verify notable scores."
msgstr "本站会缓存、排队并复用数据，以避免反复向 osu! 请求相同的信息。实时功能由本站自己的服务器投影数据构建，并通过刷新任务来补齐缺失的细节、核对值得关注的成绩。"

#: src/routes/dan-estimates.tsx
#~ msgid "The site does not use the accuracy the game showed you. It works it out again from your judgements, the 300s, 200s, 100s and so on. Mania has two ways of adding those up, the stable formula and the ScoreV2 one that lazer shows, and each ladder writes its bar in one of them: 4K regular in stable, 4K LN in ScoreV2. Since the two print different numbers for the same play, recomputing is what makes that play count, or not count, the same on either client."
#~ msgstr "本站不用游戏里显示给你的准确率，而是拿你的判定，300、200、100 这些，重新算一遍。mania 有两种加总方式，stable 的算法和 lazer 显示的 ScoreV2 算法，每张段位表的线都是用其中一种写的：4K 单点用 stable，4K LN 用 ScoreV2。同一个成绩在两种算法下算出来的数字不一样，所以只有重新算一遍，这个成绩算不算数在两个客户端上才是一致的。"

#: src/routes/dan-estimates.tsx
#~ msgid "The site downloads the chart file, reads the notes, and runs the pattern through a rating engine. Which engine depends on the keymode, because no single one is best at all of them:"
#~ msgstr "本站会下载谱面文件，读出音符，再把谱型交给一个评分算法。用哪个算法取决于键数，因为没有哪一个在所有键数上都是最好的："

#: src/routes/dan-estimates.tsx
msgid "The site notices you are playing through osu!'s feed of new scores, and that feed only lists scores on charts with a leaderboard, so a play on a graveyarded chart never shows up in it. Your recent plays are a separate lookup that does include graveyarded charts, but it has to be asked per player, so the site only starts asking once a leaderboard score shows you are playing, and keeps asking every few minutes until you stop, meaning 30 minutes pass without a new play. Everything it finds during that time counts, including unranked charts. <0>If you only play unranked charts, nothing is recorded automatically.</0>"
msgstr "本站是通过 osu! 的新成绩信息流知道你在打的，而那个信息流只列出有排行榜谱面上的成绩，所以坟场谱面上的成绩根本不会出现在里面。你的最近成绩是另一个查询，坟场谱面的成绩它是包含的，但它只能按玩家逐个去查，所以只有当一个有排行榜的成绩表明你在打时，本站才开始查，并每隔几分钟查一次，直到你停下来，也就是 30 分钟没有新成绩。这段时间里查到的都算，包括未上架谱面。<0>如果你只打未上架谱面，什么都不会被自动记录。</0>"

#: src/routes/dan-estimates.tsx
