#: src/routes/dan-estimates.tsx
#~ msgid "These estimates are not real dan clears. Nobody here has been checked against a dan course. Instead, every chart gets a dan level of its own, and your level is read from the charts you have already passed. That is why every estimated dan is written with a \"~\" in front of it and why the leaderboard calls itself a rough ordering."
#~ msgstr "这些估算都不是真正的段位通过，这里的玩家都没有接受过段位课题认定。取而代之的是，每张谱面都会得到自己的段位，再根据你已经通过的谱面推算你的水平。因此，每个估算段位前都会带「~」，排行榜也因此只被称作粗略排序。"

#: src/routes/dan-estimates.tsx
