#: src/routes/dan-estimates.tsx
#~ msgid "Unranked plays are only recorded after tracking picks up your session from your first score on a ranked, qualified or loved chart. It then checks your recent plays every few minutes until you stop, and everything you play during that time counts, including unranked charts. <0>If you only play unranked charts, nothing is recorded until you set a score on a chart with a leaderboard.</0>"
#~ msgstr "只有当你先在上架、qualified 或 loved 谱面上打出成绩，追踪检测到这场游玩后，未上架谱面的成绩才会开始记录。之后会每隔几分钟检查一次最近成绩，直到你停止游玩；这段时间里的所有成绩都会计入，包括未上架谱面。<0>如果你只打未上架谱面，那么在有排行榜的谱面上打出成绩之前，什么都不会被记录。</0>"

#: src/routes/dan-estimates.tsx
#~ msgid "Unranked plays are only recorded once the site knows you are playing, which it learns from your first score on a ranked, qualified or loved chart. After that it checks your recent plays every few minutes until you stop, and everything you play during that time counts, including unranked charts. <0>If you only play unranked charts, nothing is recorded until you set a score on a chart with a leaderboard.</0>"
#~ msgstr "未上架谱面的成绩只有在本站知道你正在打的时候才会记录，而这一点是通过你在 ranked、qualified 或 loved 谱面上的第一个成绩得知的。之后它每隔几分钟检查一次你的最近成绩，直到你停下来，这段时间里你打的都算，包括未上架的谱面。<0>如果你只打未上架的谱面，那么在你于有排行榜的谱面上打出成绩之前，什么都不会被记录。</0>"

#: src/routes/dan-estimates.tsx
#~ msgid "Unranked plays are only recorded once the site knows you are playing, which it learns from your first score on a ranked, qualified or loved chart. After that it checks your recent plays every few minutes until you stop, and everything you play during that time counts, including unranked charts. If you only play unranked charts, nothing is recorded until you set a score on a chart with a leaderboard."
#~ msgstr "未上架谱面的成绩只有在本站知道你正在打的时候才会记录，而这一点是通过你在 ranked、qualified 或 loved 谱面上的第一个成绩得知的。之后它每隔几分钟检查一次你的最近成绩，直到你停下来，这段时间里你打的都算，包括未上架的谱面。<0>如果你只打未上架的谱面，那么在你于有排行榜的谱面上打出成绩之前，什么都不会被记录。</0>"

#: src/routes/dan-estimates.tsx
#~ msgid "Unranked plays only start counting once the site knows you are playing, which it learns from your first score on a ranked, qualified or loved chart. After that it checks your recent plays every couple of minutes until you stop, and everything in that window counts, unranked charts included. Start on a graveyard map and none of it is kept until that first leaderboard score lands."
#~ msgstr "未上架谱面的成绩要等本站知道你在玩才开始算，它靠你在上架、过审或社区喜爱谱面上的第一个成绩来判断。之后每隔几分钟检查一次你的最近成绩，直到你停下为止，这段时间里的一切都会计入，未上架的谱面也算。如果你从坟场谱面开打，在第一个带排行榜的成绩出现之前，什么都不会保留。"

#: src/routes/dan-estimates.tsx
#~ msgid "Unranked plays wait until the site knows you are playing, which it learns from your first score on a ranked, qualified or loved chart. From there it checks your recent plays every couple of minutes until you stop, and everything in that window counts, unranked charts included. Before that first leaderboard score, plays on unranked charts are not kept at all."
#~ msgstr "未上架谱面的成绩要等本站知道你在打才算，而这一点是从你在 ranked、qualified 或 loved 谱面上的第一个成绩看出来的。从那之后它每隔几分钟查一次你的最近成绩，直到你停下，这段时间里打的都算，包括未上架的谱面。在那第一个有排行榜的成绩之前，未上架谱面上的成绩根本不会保存。"

#: src/routes/dan-estimates.tsx
#~ msgid "Unranked plays wait until the site knows you are playing, which it learns from your first score on a ranked, qualified or loved chart. From there it checks your recent plays every couple of minutes until you stop, and everything in that window counts, unranked charts included. Start a session on a graveyard map and none of it is kept until that first leaderboard score lands."
#~ msgstr "未上架谱面的成绩要等到本站知道你在玩，它靠你在上架、过审或社区喜爱谱面上的第一个成绩来判断。从那之后每隔几分钟检查一次你的最近成绩，直到你停下为止，这段时间里的一切都会计入，未上架的谱面也算。如果这一场从坟场谱面开始，在第一个带排行榜的成绩出现之前，什么都不会保留。"

