#: src/routes/dan-estimates.tsx
msgid "Your estimate for a side is the plain arithmetic average of the skill dans you have. Skills at 10, 9, 7 and 6 make an estimate of 8. If it lands at the very top of a ladder, the badge switches from \"~\" to \">\" and reads as <0>beyond</0> that level instead of pinning you to it, because the ladder has run out of levels to measure you with."
msgstr "你在某一侧的估算，就是你已有的那些技能段位的算术平均。10、9、7、6 这四个技能，算出来的估算是 8。如果它正好落在段位表的最顶端，标记会从「~」变成「>」，读作<0>高于</0>那个段位，而不是把你钉在上面，因为段位表已经没有更高的级别来衡量你了。"

#: src/routes/dan-estimates.tsx
#~ msgid "Your estimate is alpha++, the 4th one. The gamma pass does not make you gamma: one chart can be a lucky run, a chart that happens to suit you, or the one attempt out of fifty that stayed above the accuracy bar. Asking for four of them is what keeps a single good day from setting your level."
#~ msgstr "你的估算是 alpha++，也就是第四个。那次 gamma 的通过不会让你变成 gamma：一张谱面可能是运气好，可能刚好对你的口味，也可能是五十次里唯一一次准确率没掉下来的。要求凑够四次，就是为了不让某一天的手感决定你的段位。"

#: src/routes/dan-estimates.tsx
#~ msgid "Your jack dan is alpha++, the 4th one. The gamma pass does not make you gamma: one chart can be a lucky run, a chart that happens to suit you, or the one attempt out of fifty that stayed above the accuracy bar. Asking for four of them is what keeps a single good day from setting your level."
#~ msgstr "你的叠段位是 alpha++，也就是第四个。那次 gamma 的通过不会让你变成 gamma：一张谱面可能是运气好，可能刚好对你的口味，也可能是五十次里唯一一次准确率没掉下来的。要求凑够四次，就是为了不让某一天的手感决定你的段位。"

#: src/routes/dan-estimates.tsx
#~ msgid "Your jack dan is the average of the five highlighted passes. The gamma pass does not make you gamma on its own: averaged against the four below it, it can pull your dan up a fraction of a level, but it cannot set it."
#~ msgstr "你的叠段位是高亮那五次通过的平均。那次 gamma 的通过本身不会让你变成 gamma：和它下面那四次放在一起平均，它最多把你的段位拉高一点，但决定不了它。"

#: src/routes/dan-estimates.tsx
#~ msgid "Your jack dan is the average of the five highlighted passes. The gamma pass does not make you gamma on its own: one chart can be a lucky run, a chart that happens to suit you, or the one attempt out of fifty that stayed above the accuracy bar. Averaged against the four below it, it can pull your dan up a fraction of a level, but it cannot set it."
#~ msgstr "你的叠段位是高亮那五次通过的平均。那次 gamma 的通过本身不会让你变成 gamma：一张谱面可能是运气好，可能刚好对你的口味，也可能是五十次里唯一一次准确率没掉下来的。和它下面那四次放在一起平均，它最多把你的段位拉高一点，但决定不了它。"

#: src/routes/dan-estimates.tsx
msgid "Your jack dan is the average of your 20 best of these. The gamma pass does not make you gamma on its own: averaged against everything below it, it can pull your dan up a fraction of a level, but it cannot set it."
msgstr "你的叠段位是其中最好 20 次通过的平均。那次 gamma 的通过本身不会让你变成 gamma：和它下面的那些放在一起平均，它最多把你的段位拉高一点，但决定不了它。"

